<title>USA: Proteon, Microvitec in rights deal.</title>
<headline>Proteon, Microvitec in rights deal.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proteon Inc on Tuesday said it signed an agreement under which Microvitec Plc will acquire intellectual property rights to certain of its Ethernet and computer switching products.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Proteon said Microvitec would market these products and others to be announced under the label of Proteon LAN Products by Microvitec.&quot;</p>
<p>The agreement provides Microvitec, based in Bradford, England, with access to national distribution channels in the United States through cooperation with Proteon.</p>
</text>
